{
  "description": "Rush attacks (#10144), the game's 'Charge' (Sprint+Power Strike, combat_rush_attack): the short sword with every skill module against an orc with 1000 health, a new one for each rush, from 360 units, every key held through console lines. Three each of: charge (+attack 1 s), then +forward +sprint and release 0.6 s later; sprint 0.6 s, then +attack held 1 s or 0.3 s; and a run without sprint after a 1 s charge.",
